    "catalogue_description": "This map is okay. It\u2019s as promised, an open flat ground. The out of the map detail could use some work, like the low-resolution tree wall, and the completely horizontal cliff. The foliage work is alright, but there\u2019s not much you can do about making a flat open ground look nice. Some wallbuys are in weird places like a rock, and the box just floats on the water. Strats: Just train the zombies anywhere of your choosing, as long as it\u2019s not in the water, the water slows you down. There\u2019s no good spot to camp so stay with training",
